{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網絡近日流傳一段車Cam影片，事發於昨日（6日）下午 4 時 31 分，車Cam車主沿斜路行駛期間，突有一名身穿校服的男生橫過馬路，令人捏一把汗的是，該男生全程雙眼緊盯手機屏幕，完全沒有抬頭查看路況。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-18h20m33s061.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026fpveGgA7xn1791368671.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-18h20m33s061.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-18h20m38s235.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026PchMaljA0S1791368686.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-10-07-18h20m38s235.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">車Cam車主見狀立時響咹警示，男生被突如其來的喇叭聲嚇得如夢初醒、當場嚇了一跳，隨即停下。待車輛駛過後，他才急步橫過馬路。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">樓主將影片分享至網絡並苦勸：「這陷阱這陷阱偏我遇上,我知電話好好玩,但過馬路唔好玩好冇 」。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">片段引來大批網民圍觀，眾人紛紛指責該男生的駕駛安全意識薄弱大批網民怒轟其行為隨時禍及無辜司機，留言指：「 害司機系列」、「成鬼日望住部死人電話！睇小陣會死？！」亦有網民無奈表示同類情況日日發生，留言指：「日日大把」、「其實過馬路唔睇手機有幾難？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T10:59:14.438365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":333,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}